&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Housing stipend&lt;/strong&gt; for interns relocating to the area&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commuter benefit&lt;/strong&gt; to support local transportation&lt;/li&gt;
