&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Consider your benefits covered for launch.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; At Varda, we invest in benefits and perks that support your health, financial well-being, and life beyond work. Benefits vary by position, with packages designed specifically for our regular full-time employees and interns.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
