&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;100% company-paid Medical, Dental, and Vision insurance plans for employees and dependents with FSA and employer-matched HSA options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;$120/month wellness reimbursement for gym and fitness expenses&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
