&lt;li&gt;Experience analyzing aerodynamic data from test, CFD, flight, and other sources and documenting findings rigorously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running CFD and DSMC simulations of hypersonic and subsonic flows (Fun3D, LAURA, DPLR, US3D, SPARTA, DAC, CBAero)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable building structured and unstructured meshes in Pointwise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in MATLAB or Python&lt;/li&gt;
